      "title": "ez-comfy-stack · Flux → LTX",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "ez-comfy-stack lab template (Flux.2 Klein NVFP4 → LTX-2.3)\n\nNOT the default Z-Image Turbo community template (wrong model pack).\n\nHost setup:\n  1. ./scripts/manage.sh download-models\n  2. ./scripts/manage.sh start\n  3. Load THIS workflow (user/default/workflows/lab-flux-to-ltx.json)\n\nModels this graph expects (after download-models + link_into_comfy):\n  diffusion_models/\n    flux-2-klein-9b-nvfp4.safetensors\n    ltx-2.3-22b-distilled_transformer_only_fp8_input_scaled_v3.safetensors\n  text_encoders/\n    ltx-2.3_text_projection_bf16.safetensors\n  vae/\n    LTX23_video_vae_bf16.safetensors\n    LTX23_audio_vae_bf16.safetensors\n\nFlux stage (left): diffusion loaders for Klein NVFP4.\nWire UNET → your Flux.2 sampler / TE stack for this Comfy build\n(Flux.2 often needs companion TE/VAE from the Flux.2 family if not embedded).\n\nLTX stage (right): loaders for Kijai split LTX-2.3 balanced FP8 pack.\nConnect image latents → LTX I2V nodes (core or Kijai) using the LTX UNET + VAEs.\n\nMemory: MEM_LIMIT≈90g · restart:no · stop before reboot: manage.sh stop"
      ],
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#544"
    },
